    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Personal pronouns",
     "texto": [
      "In **Wysyłam jej wiadomość**, **jej** means «to her» and appears after the verb.",
      "**Ich** can mean «them» as an object: **Odwiedzam ich** («I visit them»). In English these pronouns usually come after the verb."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
